{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/keyboardshortcuts"]}],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"role":"collectionGroup","title":"Keyboard Shortcuts","roleHeading":"API Collection"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit uses a layered event dispatch system. When a key is pressed, it passes through up to five layers. The first layer that consumes the event wins: remaining layers are skipped. Layer 0 (text input) and Layer 3 (focus system) are mutually exclusive: when a text input element is focused, Layer 0 runs and Layer 3 is skipped."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"keyboard-event-dispatch.png","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Additionally, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Ctrl+C"},{"type":"text","text":" (SIGINT) is handled at the OS signal level "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}]},{"type":"text","text":" any of these layers: it always terminates the application."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Available-Keys","type":"heading","text":"Available Keys"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Key"},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines all keys that TUIkit can recognize from terminal input:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Character-Keys","type":"heading","text":"Character Keys"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Any printable character is represented as ","type":"text"},{"code":".character(Character)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":[".onKeyPress(Key.from(\"x\")) {","    \/\/ handle \"x\" key","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Uppercase detection: when a capital letter is typed, the resulting ","type":"text"},{"code":"KeyEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has ","type":"text"},{"code":"shift: true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" set automatically.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Special-Keys","type":"heading","text":"Special Keys"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".escape","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Escape key"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".enter","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Enter \/ Return","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".tab","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tab","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".backspace"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Backspace \/ Delete backward"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".delete"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Forward delete"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Arrow-Keys","type":"heading","text":"Arrow Keys"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".up","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow up"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".down"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow down","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".left","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow left","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".right"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow right"}]}]]]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Navigation-Keys","type":"heading","text":"Navigation Keys"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".home"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Home","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".end","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"End","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".pageUp"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Page Up"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".pageDown","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Page Down"}]}]]]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Key-Events-and-Modifiers","type":"heading","text":"Key Events and Modifiers"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"KeyEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" combines a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Key","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with modifier flags:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["public struct KeyEvent {","    public let key: Key","    public let ctrl: Bool     \/\/ Ctrl modifier","    public let alt: Bool      \/\/ Alt \/ Option modifier","    public let shift: Bool    \/\/ Shift modifier","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The terminal encodes modifiers differently from GUI frameworks:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ctrl+letter"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Detected from ASCII control codes (0x01–0x1A). For example, ","type":"text"},{"code":"Ctrl+C","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" produces byte ","type":"text"},{"code":"0x03","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Alt+key"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Detected from ESC prefix sequences (","type":"text"},{"code":"ESC","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" followed by the key byte).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shift"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Only auto-detected for uppercase letters. The terminal does not send distinct shift codes for most keys."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Registering-Key-Handlers","type":"heading","text":"Registering Key Handlers"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the ","type":"text"},{"code":".onKeyPress()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifier to handle keyboard events in your views:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Handle-All-Keys","type":"heading","text":"Handle All Keys"},{"code":["Text(\"Press any key\")","    .onKeyPress { event in","        if event.key == .enter {","            doSomething()","            return true   \/\/ consumed: stops propagation","        }","        return false      \/\/ not consumed: passes to next handler","    }"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Handle-Specific-Keys","type":"heading","text":"Handle Specific Keys"},{"code":["Text(\"Use arrow keys\")","    .onKeyPress(keys: [.up, .down]) { event in","        if event.key == .up { moveUp() }","        else { moveDown() }","        return true","    }"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Handle-a-Single-Key","type":"heading","text":"Handle a Single Key"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The single-key variant always consumes the event:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["Text(\"Press Enter to continue\")","    .onKeyPress(.enter) {","        continueAction()","    }"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Handler-Priority","type":"heading","text":"Handler Priority"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handlers are dispatched in "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"reverse registration order","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the deepest view in the tree (most recently registered) gets the event first. This means inner views can intercept events before outer views see them."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["VStack {","    Text(\"Outer\")","        .onKeyPress(.enter) {","            \/\/ Only reached if inner handler did NOT consume it","            print(\"outer enter\")","        }","    Text(\"Inner\")","        .onKeyPress(.enter) {","            \/\/ Gets the event FIRST","            print(\"inner enter\")","        }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All key handlers are re-registered every render frame. If a view is not rendered (e.g. behind a conditional), its handlers are not active.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Focus-Navigation","type":"heading","text":"Focus Navigation"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"FocusManager","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" dispatches key events in three steps:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Focused element delegation","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the focused element’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handleKeyEvent(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is called first. If it consumes the event, dispatch stops."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tab \/ Shift+Tab","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": cycles focus between elements (wraps around).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow key fallback"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Up\/Left move to the previous element in the section, Down\/Right move to the next. This only triggers if the focused element did not consume the arrow key in step 1.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Action","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tab","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus to the next focusable element (wraps around)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shift+Tab"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Move focus to the previous focusable element (wraps around)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Up \/ Left","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Move to previous element in section (fallback)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Down \/ Right"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Move to next element in section (fallback)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For more details, see "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Default-Bindings","type":"heading","text":"Default Bindings"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Layer 4 provides three built-in key bindings that work without any configuration:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Action","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Condition"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"Q","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Quit application"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only when "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior"},{"type":"text","text":" allows it"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"t"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"T"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Cycle to next color theme","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Only when theme cycling is enabled","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"a","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":"A","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cycle to next appearance"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Always active"}]}]]]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Quit-Behavior","type":"heading","text":"Quit Behavior"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" enum controls when "},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is allowed to quit:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Value"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Behavior"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".always"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" quits from any screen (default)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".rootOnly"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" only quits when no status bar context is pushed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"code":".rootOnly","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is useful for modal dialogs: push a status bar context for the dialog, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" will be blocked until the user dismisses it:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["Dialog(title: \"Confirm\") {","    Text(\"Are you sure?\")","} footer: {","    ButtonRow {","        Button(\"Yes\") { confirm() }","        Button(\"No\") { cancel() }","    }","}",".statusBarItems(context: \"confirm-dialog\") {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"y\", label: \"yes\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"n\", label: \"no\")","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Changing-the-built-in-quit-key","type":"heading","text":"Changing the built-in quit key"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default quit binding is configurable through "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarState\/quitShortcut","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@Environment(\\.statusBar) private var statusBar","","statusBar.quitShortcut = .escape","statusBar.quitShortcut = .ctrlQ","statusBar.quitShortcut = QuitShortcut(","    key: .f12,","    shortcutSymbol: Shortcut.f12,","    label: \"exit\"",")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This changes both the Layer 4 quit binding and the displayed system item."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Overriding-q-in-a-local-view-context","type":"heading","text":"Overriding `q` in a local view context"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A user-defined status bar item with shortcut ","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and an action intercepts the key before the default quit binding runs:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["EditorView()","    .statusBarItems {","        StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"q\", label: \"close\") {","            dismissEditor()","        }","    }"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the correct way to repurpose ","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for a specific screen, dialog, or focus section. The matching user item handles the event in Layer 1, so Layer 4’s built-in quit binding is never reached.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Status-Bar-Shortcuts","type":"heading","text":"Status Bar Shortcuts"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The status bar displays available shortcuts to the user. Use the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Shortcut","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" namespace for consistent, platform-standard symbols:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Display-Symbols","type":"heading","text":"Display Symbols"},{"code":[".statusBarItems {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter)","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.escape, label: \"back\")","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Common-Symbols","type":"heading","text":"Common Symbols"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Symbol"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Constant"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⎋"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.escape"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Escape"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↵"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.enter","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Enter","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⇥"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.tab"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"⇤","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.shiftTab"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shift+Tab"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"⌫","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.backspace"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Backspace","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌦"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.delete","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Delete"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"␣","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.space"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Space"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↑"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowUp","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow up"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↓"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowDown"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow down"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"←","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowLeft","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{